  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "般配，这句话忽然使我对她自愧弗如。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Well matched. Those words suddenly made me feel ashamed that I was no match for her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "这句话，让我清楚地感到在朝仓眼里所映现的这个我。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Those words made me clearly sense the version of myself reflected in Asakura's eyes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我顿时觉得寂寥了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At once I felt lonely.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "道子刚强，我脆弱；",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Michiko was strong, while I was fragile;",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "道子开朗，我忧郁；",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Michiko was cheerful, while I was melancholy;",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "道子活泼爱热闹，我消沉喜欢孤独。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Michiko was lively and loved bustle, while I was gloomy and preferred solitude.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "但是，谁有这种想法，说明谁就不理解我。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But anyone who thought that way simply did not understand me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00658",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "我有点抵触。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I felt a little resistance.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
